    MC @ think "(Uma chama azul... Por quê?)"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:890
translate ptBR qst_dreamhouse_l2_dining_oneoff_82f181a3:

    # "Entering the dining hall, the table had become a ghoulish display of gore, as the creatures crowded around it."
    "Entrando no salão de jantar, a mesa havia se tornado uma exibição horripilante de sangue, enquanto as criaturas se aglomeravam ao redor dela."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:891
translate ptBR qst_dreamhouse_l2_dining_oneoff_d8a8a7a0:

    # "Guts, blood, and indiscernible flesh sprawled across the table as they grabbed at the meat with their bare hands and devoured it."
    "Tripas, sangue e carne indiscernível espalhados pela mesa enquanto eles agarravam a carne com suas mãos nuas e a devoravam."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:892
translate ptBR qst_dreamhouse_l2_dining_oneoff_d34ae079:

    # "The wretched smell of rot and death was too much for Kiara, who hurled onto the floor."
    "O cheiro miserável de podridão e morte era demais para Kiara, que vomitou no chão."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:893
translate ptBR qst_dreamhouse_l2_dining_oneoff_fdae0222:

    # KIARA @ scared "Oh gods..."
    KIARA @ scared "Ah deuses..."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:894
translate ptBR qst_dreamhouse_l2_dining_oneoff_6f1abb01:

    # "As she did so, the dead looked up, dropping the meat in their hands as they began shambling towards us!"
    "As she did so, the dead looked up, dropping the meat in their hands as they began shambling towards us!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:897
translate ptBR qst_dreamhouse_l2_dining_oneoff_6e8ae10d:

    # MARKUS @ angry "I FUCKING HATE THIS HOUSE!"
    MARKUS @ angry "EU ODEIO PRA CARALHO ESTA CASA!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:905
translate ptBR qst_dreamhouse_l2_dining_oneoff_a623fccf:

    # MARKUS @ shock "{i}*Huff*{/i} I think that's the last of them."
    MARKUS @ shock "{i}*Arf*{/i} Acho que esse foi o último deles."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:908
translate ptBR qst_dreamhouse_l2_dining_oneoff_fdd90545:

    # VES @ angry "These creatures only fall when their head is cleaved from their neck!"
    VES @ angry "Essas criaturas só caem quando a cabeça é decepada do pescoço!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:910
translate ptBR qst_dreamhouse_l2_dining_oneoff_b8b1ec09:

    # VES @ angry "How tedious!"
    VES @ angry "Que tedioso!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:913
translate ptBR qst_dreamhouse_l2_dining_oneoff_4b748bc8:

    # SYPHA @ think "We can't stay here, come on."
    SYPHA @ think "Não podemos ficar aqui, vamos."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:918
translate ptBR qst_dreamhouse_l2_table_f89a89b8:

    # "(... Gods, what a nightmare.)"
    "(... Deuses, que pesadelo.)"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:923
translate ptBR qst_dreamhouse_l2_wolfhead_a1f17cb0:

    # "BARK!"
    "AU!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:924
translate ptBR qst_dreamhouse_l2_wolfhead_4f314bba:

    # "The mounted head snapped towards me with its jaws."
    "A cabeça montada disparou em minha direção com suas mandíbulas."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:925
translate ptBR qst_dreamhouse_l2_wolfhead_41224f04:

    # "(Is it... Is it still alive?)"
    "(Está... Ainda está viva?)"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:930
translate ptBR qst_dreamhouse_l2_portrait_d934f7a2:

    # "That's... disturbing."
    "Isso é... perturbador."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:936
translate ptBR qst_dreamhouse_l2_kitchen_oneoff_b0b44ff1:

    # "As we entered the kitchen, I heard the slamming of the cleaver as we looked to find one of the dead,"
    "Quando entramos na cozinha, ouvi o bater do cutelo enquanto olhávamos para encontrar um dos mortos,"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:938
translate ptBR qst_dreamhouse_l2_kitchen_oneoff_f0272186:

    # "a huge, decrepit, bulking figure hacking away at a man."
    "a huge, decrepit, bulking figure hacking away at a man."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:939
translate ptBR qst_dreamhouse_l2_kitchen_oneoff_ec7e5b88:

    # "Still barely alive and choking on blood, the man reached out towards us in one desperate final act, only for the creature to hack off his fingers with the cleaver."
    "Ainda mal vivo e engasgando com sangue, o homem estendeu a mão para nós em um último ato desesperado, apenas para a criatura cortar seus dedos com o cutelo."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:940
translate ptBR qst_dreamhouse_l2_kitchen_oneoff_e99e910f:

    # "As the fingers dropped to the floor, the ghoulish creature turned towards us, placing down a platter of the man's remains on the table,"
    "Enquanto os dedos caíam no chão, a criatura horripilante se virou para nós, colocando uma travessa dos restos do homem na mesa,"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:941
translate ptBR qst_dreamhouse_l2_kitchen_oneoff_b108b59f:

    # "it then stared blankly towards us, expectantly."
    "então ela olhou fixamente para nós, expectante."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:942
translate ptBR qst_dreamhouse_l2_kitchen_oneoff_64cf87e1:

    # MARKUS @ scared "Does... Does this fucking thing expect us to eat that?!"
    MARKUS @ scared "Essa... Essa porra dessa coisa espera que a gente coma isso?!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:945
translate ptBR qst_dreamhouse_l2_kitchen_oneoff_53d44a4b:

    # "Carefully, I reached over to grab a piece of the meat."
    "Cuidadosamente, estendi a mão para pegar um pedaço da carne."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:946
translate ptBR qst_dreamhouse_l2_kitchen_oneoff_2f9ce75e:

    # "With a shaky hand, I pushed the wet meat into my mouth as the creature offered a drooling grin of approval."
    "Com a mão trêmula, empurrei a carne molhada em minha boca enquanto a criatura oferecia um sorriso babado de aprovação."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:947
translate ptBR qst_dreamhouse_l2_kitchen_oneoff_ed932dcd:

    # "Markus pulled back in revulsion as Kiara looked like she was about to hurl."
    "Markus recuou em repulsa enquanto Kiara parecia prestes a vomitar."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:948
translate ptBR qst_dreamhouse_l2_kitchen_oneoff_2bce3932:

    # "The wet meat squeelched between my teeth, almost making me wretch as my eyes began to water from the foul taste."
    "A carne molhada guinchou entre meus dentes, quase me fazendo vomitar enquanto meus olhos começavam a lacrimejar do gosto podre."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:949
translate ptBR qst_dreamhouse_l2_kitchen_oneoff_cf947b80:

    # KIARA @ sad "Oh gods... I might... I think I'm gonna be sick."
    KIARA @ sad "Ah deuses... Acho que vou... Acho que vou vomitar."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:950
translate ptBR qst_dreamhouse_l2_kitchen_oneoff_d069021e:

    # MARKUS @ scared "What in the hells is wrong with you?"
    MARKUS @ scared "Que diabos há de errado com você?"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:951
translate ptBR qst_dreamhouse_l2_kitchen_oneoff_d73d8a37:

    # SYPHA @ think "... Is this is some kind of masochistic ritual humans perform?"
    SYPHA @ think "... Isso é algum tipo de ritual masoquista que humanos fazem?"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:954
translate ptBR qst_dreamhouse_l2_kitchen_oneoff_18ca7ff7:

    # VES @ think "... Why no salt?"
    VES @ think "... Por que sem sal?"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:956
translate ptBR qst_dreamhouse_l2_kitchen_oneoff_c5034d4e:

    # "Seemingly satisfied that I had tasted his *food,* the creature went back to cooking, seemingly ignoring us and allowing us to pass."
    "Aparentemente satisfeita que eu tinha provado sua *comida,* a criatura voltou a cozinhar, aparentemente nos ignorando e nos permitindo passar."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:960
translate ptBR qst_dreamhouse_l2_kitchen_oneoff_806c733b:

    # "The ghoulish dead creature stared for a moment,"
    "A criatura morta horripilante olhou por um momento,"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:961
translate ptBR qst_dreamhouse_l2_kitchen_oneoff_1eb9fc7b:

    # "and realizing none of us will eat its {i}food,{/i}"
    "e percebendo que nenhum de nós comeria sua {i}comida,{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:962
translate ptBR qst_dreamhouse_l2_kitchen_oneoff_5633d180:

    # "it grabbed for the cleaver and swung it wildly towards us!"
    "ela agarrou o cutelo e o balançou descontroladamente em nossa direção!"

