translate ptBR qst_dreamhouse_l2_kitchen_cupboards_57333fb4:

    # "The cupboards bled and were filled with nothing but pungent meat in a gory mess."
    "Os armários sangravam e estavam cheios de nada além de carne pungente em uma bagunça sangrenta."

# game/data/world_quests/side/hamun/DreamHouse/scr_DreamHouse.rpy:979
